# Infrastructure paths: the verifier, the schema and the workflows define what
# "verified" means, so a change to them needs a reviewer who is not the author.
#
# Binding requires two things outside this file:
#   1. a second maintainer account listed below (the agent and the operator
#      must not share one GitHub identity);
#   2. "Require review from Code Owners" enabled on the `main` ruleset.
# Until both exist this file documents intent; it does not enforce it.
/scripts/            @manzke
/schemas/            @manzke
/.github/            @manzke
/tests/              @manzke
